<title>USA: Sherwin-Williams buys Stierling Group.</title>
<headline>Sherwin-Williams buys Stierling Group.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwin-Williams Co said Monday it has purchased the Stierling Group of coatings companies located in Chile.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The companies include; Industria de Pinturas Adolfo Stierling Limitada, Pinturas Baco S.A.I.C., Panamericana de Pinturas Limitada and Comercializadora de Pinturas y Revestimientos Limitada, a statement from Sherwin-Williams said.</p>
</text>
